model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "A native control failure keeps its status codes: 401 and 403 from the pool stay refusals and every other failure stays service-unavailable. When the pool was unreachable, timed out, answered 5xx or answered unreadably, the failure and the device decide answer carry the reason NATIVE_POOL_UNAVAILABLE; a host signing fault and a pool 4xx refusal do not. A JSON pool refusal adds only its own error class as dependencyCode, an identifier of at most 64 characters, never its message or any other body text. The decision is not recorded, so the same device code stays pending for another decision."
    }
  }
}
